、アタシ用じゃなくて」\nス「ミードちゃーん！\n見てみて！今日の私何か違うと思いませんか？」\nミ「…………ハイライト変えたでしょ」\nス「さすがミードちゃん！私のことよく分かってる！」\nミ「あぶね〜2択だったぜ。当てないととその日1日のパフォーマンス悪くなるんだよ」\nサ「大変ですね……」\n\nご検討よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15vf1DH2Ds3tSBt8bbPbzlmMc0m-is01B?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1337647, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "スイ🐰", "screen_name": "suimizG", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1609070287097847808/s-Xb3axG.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/235435478/1669351776/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 129}, {"id": 2044272, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "ねぎ", "screen_name": "genakiryo", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1490972991379087373/d4XNfbcw.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1051063694333886465/1730847037/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "none", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 128}, {"id": 2658180, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "タニシ‼️", "screen_name": "tanisi0893_", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1782688088327868416/6vS2kdQe.jpg", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_ex